18
00:02:11,921 --> 00:02:19,282
So every group of 10 soldiers had a chain, binding them together,

19
00:02:20,171 --> 00:02:24,769
so that if somebody wants to run away, he has to convince the whole group.

20
00:02:25,989 --> 00:02:30,419
Plus it makes it very difficult for them to move, therefore, it's almost a fixed position.

21
00:02:31,615 --> 00:02:36,141
Not all of the infantry were like that, but such a huge number of them were chained.

22
00:02:36,275 --> 00:02:40,374
And that was, I mean, not the first time this method was employed,

23
00:02:40,736 --> 00:02:46,789
