24
00:02:47,027 --> 00:02:52,765
 so this was a method employed actually to force these soldiers to fight.

25
00:02:53,926 --> 00:02:58,585
So now, it was Romans who chose this battlefield

26
00:02:58,610 --> 00:03:01,024
and when Amr Bin Al-Aas(عَمْرُو بِن اَلْعَاص), he saw that he said to the Muslims;

27
00:03:01,049 --> 00:03:05,332
أبشروا وقلما جاء محصور بخير

28
00:03:05,459 --> 00:03:11,728
Rejoice for the good news because rarely does a person, who's cornered, win.

29
00:03:12,589 --> 00:03:15,876
They are the ones, who chose to corner themselves into this position.

30
00:03:16,183 --> 00:03:19,761
So this is the beginning of the good news, that's a good omen for us.

31
00:03:21,706 --> 00:03:30,757
The Roman army was divided into squadrons that was their method in fighting.

32
00:03:31,718 --> 00:03:35,262
