40
00:04:10,364 --> 00:04:14,972
The right flank 10 squadrons we're talking about 10,000

41
00:04:15,356 --> 00:04:18,541
and this was headed by Amr Bin Al-Aas(عَمْرُو بِن اَلْعَاص)

42
