68
00:06:15,156 --> 00:06:20,131
So the army has to have a judge, and that was a Abu Dardah(أبودرداء).

69
00:06:20,350 --> 00:06:22,498
Abdullah Bin Masood(عبدالله بن مسعود), he was the paymaster,

70
00:06:22,523 --> 00:06:24,467
he was dealing with the finances of the army.

71
00:06:24,702 --> 00:06:29,662
Al-Miqdad Bin Amr Bin Aswad(ألمقداد إبن عمرو بن أسود), he was the Qari(قاري) for the army.

72
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:33,023
This was something started by Rasool Allah ﷺ in the Battle of Badr(بدر).

73
