75
00:06:41,553 --> 00:06:45,668
So he would go around reciting the Ayaat(آيات) from Surat-Ul-Anfaal(سورة الأنفال) to the army.

76
00:06:46,694 --> 00:06:50,974
And this tradition was carried on and was employed in the Battle of Yarmook(يرموك)

77
00:06:51,362 --> 00:06:53,635
