78
00:06:53,948 --> 00:06:57,080
Miqdad Ibn Aswad(ألمقداد إبن أسود), who did it in the Battle of Badr(بدر) with Rasool Allah ﷺ.

79
00:06:57,323 --> 00:07:02,352
