00:07:46,867 --> 00:07:54,066
And they support and advise each other in Haqq(حَقّ) and Sabr(صبر), in the truth,

95
00:07:54,514 --> 00:07:58,070
they advise each other to follow Al-Haqq(ألحَقّ), which is Islam, the truth

