Make your striving sincere, Ikhlaas(إخلاص),

151
00:11:45,251 --> 00:11:47,051
he is giving them the Naseeha(نَصيحة) of Ikhlaas(إخلاص),

152
00:11:47,438 --> 00:11:51,855
which is very important in every Ibadah(عبادة), especially in their Ibadah(عبادة) of Jihad(جهاد)

