They fail to see that, it is for the sake of Allahعَزَّوَجَلْ

170
00:13:21,209 --> 00:13:28,577
a person who's dying is dying for the sake of Allahعَزَّوَجَلْ for something greater, for Jannah(جنة), to please Allahعَزَّوَجَلْ.

